---
const listenHref = '/b/0236';
const playHref = '/yee/0236';
---

<section class="morning-listening" id="morning-listening" aria-labelledby="morning-listening-title">
  <a class="morning-listening__picture" href={listenHref} aria-label="Listen to Temple Sounds’ singing bowls">
    <img
      src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-ar9vsmFhJU/hqdefault.jpg"
      alt="Temple Sounds’ Himalayan singing-bowl session"
      width="480"
      height="360"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <span aria-hidden="true">▶ &nbsp; PRESS PLAY. TAKE YOUR TIME.</span>
  </a>
  <div class="morning-listening__copy">
    <p class="morning-listening__eyebrow">Morning listening · Temple Sounds</p>
    <h2 id="morning-listening-title">Let the morning <em>ring.</em></h2>
    <p class="morning-listening__dek">Long singing-bowl tones and a little room to start the day. Settle in, press play, and listen for a while.</p>
    <div class="morning-listening__actions">
      <a class="morning-listening__listen" href={listenHref}>Listen to the bowls <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      <a href={playHref}>Play the tones <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
    <p class="morning-listening__note">Feel like joining in? Follow the colored cues in YeePlayer with a tap or the space bar.</p>
    <p class="morning-listening__next"><a href="/ghost-town/">Next listen: Ghost Town + a little flight <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .morning-listening { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .85fr) minmax(0, 1.4fr); margin: 22px 7px 26px 0; border: 2px solid #332919; background: #fff7e7; box-shadow: 7px 7px 0 #b99152; color: #332919; }
  .morning-listening__picture { position: relative; display: flex; min-width: 0; align-items: center; background: #24261f; border-right: 2px solid #332919; overflow: hidden; }
  .morning-listening__picture img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .morning-listening__picture span { position: absolute; bottom: 0; inset-inline: 0; padding: 13px 16px; background: #332919; color: #fff7e7; font: 650 9px/1.5 var(--pc-font-mono); letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .morning-listening__copy { padding: clamp(22px, 3.5vw, 42px); align-self: center; }
  .morning-listening__eyebrow { margin: 0 0 14px; color: #735326; font: 650 10px/1.5 var(--pc-font-mono); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .morning-listening h2 { margin: 0; max-width: 15ch; font: 750 clamp(34px, 4.1vw, 58px)/1.03 var(--pc-font-sans); letter-spacing: -.045em; text-wrap: balance; }
  .morning-listening h2 em { color: #8b5629; font-style: normal; }
  .morning-listening__dek { margin: 16px 0 22px; max-width: 46ch; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .morning-listening__actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px 20px; }
  .morning-listening__actions a { display: inline-flex; min-height: 44px; align-items: center; gap: 14px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .morning-listening__actions .morning-listening__listen { padding: 11px 17px; background: #332919; color: #fff7e7; text-decoration: none; }
  .morning-listening__actions .morning-listening__listen:hover { background: #604526; }
  .morning-listening__note { margin: 18px 0 0; max-width: 48ch; color: #685943; font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .morning-listening__next { margin: 15px 0 0; padding-top: 13px; border-top: 1px solid #d8c7aa; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.6; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .morning-listening a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #185fa5; outline-offset: 4px; }
  .morning-listening__picture:focus-visible { outline-offset: -5px; }
  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .morning-listening { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .morning-listening__picture { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 2px solid #332919; }
    .morning-listening__copy { padding: 24px 20px; }
  }
</style>
